page='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Music and Artists | InAct Entertainment</title><meta name="description" content="Human imagination meets AI. Explore InAct Entertainment’s experimental artists, original music, and BluDawn’s Golden Rays."><link rel="canonical" href="https://inactentertainment.github.io/ie/music.html"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/site.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/learning-ui.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/brand-refresh.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/music-world.css"></head><body class="music-world" id="top"><a class="skip" href="#music-main">Skip to Music and Artists</a>'''+header+release+'''<main id="music-main"><nav class="music-local-nav" aria-label="Music page navigation"><a href="#artists">Artists</a><a href="#releases">Music</a><a href="#studio-story">Our experiment</a><a href="#music-connect">Collaborate</a></nav><section class="music-hero"><div class="music-hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">ie Music and Artists · Human-directed AI</span><h1>Sound has<br>no final form.</h1><p class="music-lead">New sounds. New identities.<br>One human spark.</p><p>We create music and experimental artist identities to take part in an evolving way of making and listening. Imagination sets the direction. Technology opens another door. This is an experiment. Let it resonate.</p><div class="music-actions"><a class="platinum" href="#releases">Explore the music →</a><a class="outline" href="#artists">Meet the artists →</a></div></div><div class="hero-record" aria-hidden="true"><div class="record-rings"></div><img src="assets/ie-record.svg" alt=""><span>Human imagination. Endless ripples.</span></div></section><section class="music-section" id="artists"><div class="music-section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Current artists</span><h2>A new dawn.<br>A different kind of artist.</h2><p>A creative identity built around sound, story, and an openly experimental approach.</p></div><article class="artist-feature"><div class="artist-art"><img src="assets/release-cover.svg" alt="BluDawn Golden Rays artwork"><span class="artist-label">Experimental AI artist</span></div><div class="artist-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Featured artist · InAct Entertainment</span><h3>BluDawn</h3><p class="artist-tagline">Afrobeat soul. R&B vibes. Timeless energy.</p><p>BluDawn is an experimental AI artist identity developed by InAct Entertainment. The project blends Afrobeat-inspired rhythm, R&B warmth, and pop energy into a world of light, movement, and connection.</p><p>The identity is a creative expression, rather than a claim about a real singer’s age or biography. Human direction shapes the story, sound, and presentation as we explore what an artist can mean in this changing musical landscape.</p><details class="artist-story"><summary>Step inside BluDawn’s world</summary><p>Golden Rays is the starting point: a celebration of joy, freedom, and the spark between people. The image of sunlight becomes a way to talk about hope and finding brightness after darkness. Rhythm carries that idea into a summer scene of movement and togetherness.</p><p>As the project develops, this page will bring the music, release information, and creative story together. For now, meet the sound through the official Golden Rays EP.</p></details><div class="music-actions"><a class="platinum" href="#releases">Discover Golden Rays →</a></div></div></article></section><section class="music-section" id="releases"><div class="music-section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Current music</span><h2>Golden Rays.<br>Light you can listen to.</h2><p>BluDawn’s official EP brings the experiment into focus.</p></div><div class="release-feature"><div class="music-video" id="bludawn-video"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/z2cfC1X3oI0/hqdefault.jpg" alt="BluDawn Golden Rays official video preview" loading="lazy"><button class="platinum" id="load-bludawn-video">Play the official EP ▶</button><p>Loads the official InAct Entertainment YouTube player when you choose to watch.</p></div><div class="release-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Released August 29, 2025</span><h3>Golden Rays</h3><dl><div><dt>Artist</dt><dd>BluDawn</dd></div><div><dt>Production</dt><dd>InAct Entertainment LLC</dd></div><div><dt>Sound</dt><dd>Afrobeat / R&B / Pop fusion</dd></div></dl><p>A musical world built around freedom, joy, and human connection. Listen to the official EP here or choose your preferred service.</p><blockquote>“Golden rays pouring through my window.”<cite>Golden Rays · A lyric from the release</cite></blockquote><div class="music-actions"><a class="platinum" href="https://distrokid.com/hyperfollow/bludawn/golden-rays" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Choose where to listen ↗</a><a class="outline" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z2cfC1X3oI0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section class="music-section experiment-section" id="studio-story"><span class="eyebrow">The ie experiment</span><h2>Keep the imagination human.<br>Let the possibilities evolve.</h2><div class="music-pillars"><div><span>01</span><h3>Direction</h3><p>Begin with a feeling, a listening setting, and a reason to create. A tool is part of the process; creative decisions still matter.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Identity</h3><p>Explore fictional artists as creative projects. Be clear about the experiment so listeners can understand the world they are entering.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Connection</h3><p>Bring songs, videos, stories, and learning together. The experiment grows through what we make and what people hear.</p></div></div><div class="music-actions"><a class="platinum" href="courses/music-ai.html">Explore our Music & AI course →</a><button class="outline" data-open-music>Listen while you scroll ♫</button></div></section><section class="music-section music-connect" id="music-connect"><span class="eyebrow">Artists · Creators · Collaborators</span><h2>A new ripple starts<br>with a conversation.</h2><p>Have an artist concept, a sound, or a collaboration in mind? Tell us what you want to create. This opens a project inquiry; it is not a distribution agreement or an artist signing offer.</p><div class="music-actions"><a class="platinum" href="index.html?service=Music%20%26%20creative%20media#contact">Start a music conversation →</a></div></section></main>'''+footer_markup(home).replace('../','')+'''<div class="toast" id="toast" hidden role="status"></div><script src="assets/site.js"></script><script src="assets/footer.js"></script><script src="assets/music-world.js"></script></body></html>'''
